zBkEt1VBMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2_HE52-c9Ay_DOjCApZHXoRGDt8EkRP3BFFi3Ww8U17g&oe=69F1FD4C"}, {"file_name": "Untitled design (8).png", "id": "1780617056149340", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507849536_1780617059482673_5502235327505092693_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OYHj6_SpQtMQ7kNvwFLumLk&_nc_oc=AdrQP1AGEfC4FJe2UsRntUqirKIcrA-IBnRQZwOmyGA8gsvHhmhKKsV538cFIJH4wVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0o4z1aepWu8NZuJNq-AFMAijqxnqo8KG_mAga-_h2Jdw&oe=69F20296"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled design (9).png", "id": "1134474674682203", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825050_1134474678015536_578404934795286762_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dFO6lfwSzlkQ7kNvwE2k8qe&_nc_oc=AdrZRgwAjAymph1Il-koSvH3DM0Jc-eY7hxFnOdxrpZwgZruWk1Rkdl0lA5nU_uEb_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3hPj-E0bKmB3QXbyYZp90xlQZfQIVSsFgqg2UEkcOWOw&oe=69F1E5CD"}, "display_name": "Simian", "keywords": ["Simian", "GorillaTagFangame", "PVP", "Indie"], "long_description": "Simian is a fun, well made VR experience designed for the enjoyment of anybody! It features Gorilla Tag locomotion mixed with a player vs player experience using well known weapons like a Pistol, AR, and Sniper. Simian is a community ran game, making the game a cozy and entertaining experience for all! It has different maps to play in and different modes like horror and a never seen before \"Foam Fall\".  The game is well made and well optimized for all VR headsets including the Oculus Quest 2! Simian provides a smooth and fun experience for all headsets and players. Download and join in on the fun!", "short_description": "Simian is a fun, well made VR experience designed for the enjoyment of anybody! It features Gorilla Tag locomotion mixed with a player vs player experience.  Hop in and enjoy the fun!"}]}, "developer_n